{% assign is_zh = false %}
{% if page.lang contains 'zh' %}{% assign is_zh = true %}{% endif %}
<section class="student-status">
  <div class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div>
    <strong>
      {%- if is_zh %}当前情况{% else %}Availability{% endif -%}
    </strong>
    <p>
      {% if is_zh %}
        现面向2027年入学招收学术型硕士研究生。无论是对我的研究方向感兴趣，还是已有自己的研究想法，都欢迎联系交流。
        也欢迎本科生参与科研实习与竞赛合作，以及相关领域同行开展学术交流与合作。
      {% else %}
        I am recruiting master's students for 2027 entry. Whether you are interested in my research areas or have ideas of your own, you are welcome
        to get in touch. I also welcome undergraduates interested in research internships or competition collaborations, as well as academic
        collaboration with colleagues in related fields.
      {% endif %}
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="student-section">
  <div class="section-kicker">
    {% if is_zh %}研究方向{% else %}Research topics{% endif %}
  </div>
  <h2>
    {% if is_zh %}可交流的研究主题{% else %}Potential research topics{% endif %}
  </h2>
  <div class="topic-grid">
    {% for area in site.data.research %}
      <article>
        <span>{{ area.number }}</span>
        <h3>
          {% if is_zh %}{{ area.title_zh }}{% else %}{{ area.title_en }}{% endif %}
        </h3>
        <p>
          {% if is_zh %}{{ area.tagline_zh }}{% else %}{{ area.tagline_en }}{% endif %}
        </p>
      </article>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="student-section contact-guide">
  <div>
    <div class="section-kicker">
      {% if is_zh %}联系方式{% else %}Contact{% endif %}
    </div>
    <h2>
      {% if is_zh %}联系前请提供的信息{% else %}What to include in your email{% endif %}
    </h2>
  </div>
  <div>
    <p>
      {% if is_zh %}
        请简要介绍你的教育背景、感兴趣的具体研究问题、相关经历或作品，以及预计开始时间和可投入周期。
      {% else %}
        A useful first message briefly introduces your background, the concrete question that interests you, any relevant work, and your expected
        timeline. Clarity matters more than length.
      {% endif %}
    </p>
    <span class="primary-text-link">{{ site.data.profile.email_bupt }}</span>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="teaching-placeholder">
  <strong>
    {%- if is_zh %}课程与指导{% else %}Teaching & mentoring{% endif -%}
  </strong>
  <span>
    {% if is_zh %}课程与指导信息将在确定后补充。{% else %}Course and mentoring information will be added as it becomes available.{% endif %}
  </span>
</section>
